  <textAnnotation id="Annotation_rules_version">
    <text>Exported from core/decision_table.yaml (v1, 14 Nov 2026). rules_version 5ec520cbb9fb3cd799f0ee58bf4119c0b0f7d4d2c9611ec92377f596d4fe2959. Hit policy FIRST: the first matching row answers; the last row R0 means no rule covers the change and a person decides. Inputs: the change class and, per rule id, whether that rule fired at severity blocker, warning or question.</text>
  </textAnnotation>
